Subject: Cantor B1 Operator Policy Governance Bundle Verification P0 Justification

@ [justification_uuid] 3d60422e-2db9-4e6f-8042-0d903465c283

& [Why]
  + a metadata descriptor cannot prove candidate bytes and a mathematically valid self-signed envelope cannot prove operator governance
  + separating raw identity structure and signature correspondence from A2 through A9 prevents a useful verifier from becoming an authority-laundering shortcut
  + A1 is dependency-first and can be implemented and falsified provider-free before any live ceremony material exists

& [WhyNow]
  + packet readiness is published and replayed while accountable-basket successor work is actively owned elsewhere
  + the native Windows execution lane is recovered and D-drive build isolation is available
